    <briefdescription>
<para>Result from one shard&apos;s aggregate computation. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>When aggregating across multiple shards/nodes, each shard computes a partial <ref refid="structthemis_1_1_agg_shard_result" kindref="compound">AggShardResult</ref>; the coordinator merges all partial results with <ref refid="namespacethemis_1ab1579bde7c5ba25f63305de45085a60f" kindref="member">mergeShardResults()</ref>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
